{"seq":46,"slug":"frontend-image-media-optimization","title":"前端图片与媒体优化","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization","rating":{"composite":3.74,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 前端图片与媒体优化\n\n打开一个现代网页，真正占满下载体积的往往不是 JavaScript，而是图片、视频、字体这些「富媒体」资源。HTTP Archive 长期统计显示，中位数页面的图片字节数仍占整页传输量的近一半，视频与字体加起来又是另一大块。它们既是页面的视觉主角，也是性能预算里最沉的包袱——优化它们，是把「好看」和「快」这两件常常打架的事同时做成。\n\n这个 hub 沿着四条递进的主线展开。第一条是「基础」：先说清楚为什么媒体优化值得投入，再落到两块最常用的地基技术——响应式图片（让每块屏幕只下它需要的像素）和懒加载（让首屏外的资源晚点再来）。这一章不谈具体编码格式，只谈「加载策略」这层骨架，把后面所有内容都挂上去。\n\n第二条主线是「图片格式」。同一张照片，编码方式不同，体积可以差出三五倍。这一章拆解 AVIF/WebP 这些现代格式各自的取舍、压缩与质量之间的数学权衡，以及 SVG 这种和位图完全不同的矢量世界。格式是优化里收益最直接的一环：换个编码器，常常一行配置就省下一半带宽。\n\n第三条主线是「媒体与字体」。图片之外，视频、音频和 Web 字体各有一套自己的优化语言。视频要懂容器与编解码器的搭配，流媒体要懂自适应码率如何随网络抖动切换清晰度，字体则要在「文字何时出现」和「会不会闪一下」之间走钢丝。这三块共享一个主题：如何让又大又关键的资源既快又不打断体验。\n\n第四条主线是「工程实践」，把前三章的知识落到生产线上。CDN 与缓存决定资源从哪台机器、用什么新鲜度策略送达用户；性能度量（尤其是 LCP）告诉你优化到底有没有效、效在哪里；而「陷阱与误用」收集那些看起来在优化、实则帮倒忙的反模式。\n\n四条主线是层层递进的：基础给出加载骨架，格式与媒体填充具体内容的瘦身手段，工程实践则把这些手段部署、度量、避坑。读完整个 hub，你应当能回答一个核心问题——如何让富媒体又快又省地加载，并用数据证明它确实变快了。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-media-optimization","title":"为什么媒体优化关键","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/foundations/why-media-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"responsive-images","title":"响应式图片","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/foundations/responsive-images"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lazy-loading","title":"懒加载","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/foundations/lazy-loading"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"image-formats","title":"图片格式","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/image-formats","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"modern-formats","title":"现代格式 AVIF/WebP","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/image-formats/modern-formats"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compression-quality","title":"压缩与质量","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/image-formats/compression-quality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"svg-vector","title":"SVG 与矢量","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/image-formats/svg-vector"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"media","title":"媒体与字体","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/media","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"video-audio","title":"视频与音频","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/media/video-audio"},{"seq":2,"slug":"streaming-adaptive","title":"流媒体与自适应","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/media/streaming-adaptive"},{"seq":3,"slug":"font-optimization","title":"字体优化","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/media/font-optimization"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cdn-caching","title":"CDN 与缓存","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/practice/cdn-caching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-metrics","title":"性能度量 LCP","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/practice/performance-metrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pitfalls","title":"陷阱与误用","url":"/h/frontend/frontend-image-media-optimization/practice/pitfalls"}]}]}